core-api's OpenAPI spec as released. The website reads three routes from it: overview,
ladders per edition and season stats per edition. `npm run contracts:check` fails if the
site's schemas (src/lib/core-api.ts) read a field the spec doesn't have, with a different
type, or as never-null where core-api can send null. To move to a new core-api release,
copy its openapi.json here, update the lines above, and run `npm run contracts:check`.
